:: Michael Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> is walking just a bit ahead of you, arms behind his head as he gives an amused smirk to something in the distance. You stop walking and tell him, sadly, that you have to leave for the day. <span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> turns around with a confused and annoyed look on his face.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You have to leave? Dude, we – like – just started? We’ve hardly done a thing. Why are you pissing off now? What, your daddy give you an early bedtime?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> teases. <br>

