You tell him you just have to go. It is what it is and you’re sorry he didn’t have as much fun as he thought. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever,”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> scoffs at this, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you want to be lame, be lame. I’ll find something more interesting to do. Later, lame-o!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> sticks his tongue out at you before walking off. <span style="color:LightCoral">You feel a little bad to have done so little with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> but shrug it off and walk away yourself.</span> <br>
