:: Michael Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> is walking just a bit ahead of you, arms behind his back as he smirks at something amusing just ahead of him. You stop in your tracks and tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> that, sadly, you have to leave for today. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> turns around with a raised eyebrow. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You have to leave? What, your daddy give you an early bedtime since you’re such a dweeb?”</span> He chuckles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s lame. But at least you managed to keep me somewhat entertained.”</span> He chuckles, walking over to you. <br>

