<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I guess you’re not as much as a dork as I thought. Well, you’re still a MASSIVE dork, just not totally hopeless.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> sticks his tongue out at you as you roll your eyes, saying goodbye. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Later loser, I’m going to have some real fun while you run home to daddy.”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:LightGreen">He gives one last teasing face before walking off, leaving you sighing and shaking your head at his teasing.</span> <br>
